{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1732","id":4143754337,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p872_Kxh","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1732","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1732.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1732.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1732","number":1732,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] bind P3 ProcedureInstance authority","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1722\n\n## Goal\n\nBind the merged QuestionPart / ProcedureInstance / ProcedureStepInstance contract to the admitted 3,497-row structural authority and seed the active cumulative Paper 3 semantic release without widening the Integration Techniques taxonomy.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Preserved all 296 #1719 dispositions, all 170 approved question-level primary mappings, and the predecessor question-level edges.\n- Added a checked-in 264-decision part-ownership authority. Every classification is terminally `reviewed` or `unresolved`, with exact candidate-part QP/MS anchors and source excerpt path, pointer, offsets, bytes, and hash.\n- Admitted 105 reviewed part decisions: 69 single-score-owning-part structural decisions, 27 unique explicit method-cue decisions, and 9 named manual boundary audits.\n- Failed closed 159 unresolved decisions. They emit no `PART_CLASSIFIED_AS` edge and no ProcedureInstance.\n- Audited the superseded heuristic corpus explicitly: 29 cue, 104 classifier, 130 fallback, and 1 forced-continuation cases. All 104 classifier cases are unresolved; all 130 fallback cases have terminal decisions; fallback authority count is zero.\n- Corrected the named false owners, including `s18 q08/i`, `s22 q10/a`, `s23 q09/a`, `w21 q08/a`, and `s17 q07/i`.\n- Projected exactly one part-primary classification for each admitted part while retaining predecessor question-level role separately. The critical `q07/b` edge is part-primary/by-parts with predecessor-secondary lineage, and its ProcedureInstance remains independently `supporting`.\n- Extended authenticated readback so explicit-part candidate status is derived only from that part. Question-only reads can select the actual candidate-bound part; unclassified candidate siblings remain unavailable in both approved and candidate-preview scopes.\n- Seeded 55 approved material ProcedureInstances: 54 core plus 1 supporting. Kept all 164 direct/reverse-chain records as reviewed incidental operations rather than ProcedureInstances.\n- Reconstructed six ProcedureStepInstances only for the critical composite branch.\n- Preserved byte-identical #1716 readback and deterministic #1719 readback.\n\n## Production metrics\n\n- semantic records: 296\n- preserved approved question-level primary mappings: 170\n- part-ownership decisions: 264 terminal\n- reviewed / unresolved part decisions: 105 / 159\n- part-bound semantic records: 104\n- `PART_CLASSIFIED_AS` edges: 105 across 105 unique parts\n- approved ProcedureInstances: 55\n- core / supporting ProcedureInstances: 54 / 1\n- candidate ProcedureInstances: 0\n- ProcedureStepInstances: 6\n- alternative branches: 0 (2 boundary clauses reviewed)\n- incidental-operation reviews: 164\n- approved composition product readback: 100% (55/55 instances)\n\n## Gates\n\n- `part_ownership_fallback_authority_count = 0`\n- `part_classification_primary_role_cardinality_violation_count = 0`\n- `whole_question_semantic_rollup_without_justification_count = 0`\n- `approved_procedure_instance_without_exact_part_evidence_count = 0`\n- `candidate_procedure_instance_exposed_as_approved_count = 0`\n- `duplicate_cross_family_procedure_model_count = 0`\n- `structural_authority_write_count = 0`\n- deterministic rebuild: PASS\n- exact QuestionPart QP/MS evidence readback: PASS\n- provider calls / remote writes / safe-rejection inputs: 0 / 0 / 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1722_p3_semantic_composition.test.py` — 10/10 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1722_p3_semantic_composition.py --check` — deterministic rebuild PASS\n- focused authenticated service/API Jest — 25/25 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1714_kg_v0_structural_materialization.test.py` — 15/15 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1719_integration_techniques_semantic_kg.test.py` — passed\n- `node scripts/vlm/issue_1716_kg_v0_product_readback.mjs --check` — byte-identical PASS\n- `node scripts/vlm/issue_1719_integration_techniques_readback.mjs --check` — PASS\n- #1339 segmentation Jest — 6/6 passed\n- targeted ESLint — passed\n- report artifact index — passed\n- A+ ratchet — healthy with zero warnings\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n\n## Scope\n\nLocal deterministic artifacts and authenticated readback only. No structural extraction, screenshots, provider calls, remote data writes, RAG, production mutation, safe-rejection processing, parallel schema, or full worked-solution reconstruction.\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T15:27:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T16:52:00Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T16:45:32Z","merged_at":"2026-07-27T16:45:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"7f76733e8cfae00bbc9f0620e2f768683aa2b2b6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1732/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1732/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1732/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/4353f6163529a9ff93550504587deb299a87bb2a","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1722-p3-semantic-composition","ref":"task/1722-p3-semantic-composition","sha":"4353f6163529a9ff93550504587deb299a87bb2a","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":999357095,"node_id":"R_kgDOO5D6pw","name":"ciecopilot-home","full_name":"Samsen879/ciecopilot-home","private":true,"owner":{"login":"Samsen879